# Files Bob must never read in the DocDrift workspace or in audited repositories.

# Secrets: never read real environment files (the .env.example template is allowed).
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# The benchmark answer key: if Bob could read it, the benchmark would be meaningless.
benchmark/ANSWER_KEY.md

# Evidence and notes for the hackathon submission, not part of any audit.
bob_sessions/
NOTES.md

# Large or generated folders: slow and costly to read, never needed to check docs.
**/node_modules/
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/dist/
**/obj/
**/.git/
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.ipynb
